What this is
------------

This is tmct's code domain pack: the curated tier-1 software-engineering
ontology (concepts.jsonl, definitions.jsonl, relations.jsonl) — a hand-
authored, language-neutral set of concept definitions and relation facts covering
the vocabulary declared in src/grammar/lexicon-core.json — plus the pack's own
lane vocabulary (vocab.json; count nouns, help rows, the miss-recovery pointer,
src/services/extensions.mjs). Every line was written and checked by the
project, not compiled from an external dataset.

On the name "seon"
------------------

The ontology is named for SEON (the Software Evolution ONtologies, se-on.org),
the FAMIX-derived reference vocabulary tmct's code-graph prop tokens borrow term
IDEAS from (see ontology/tmct-core.ttl). It carries the bundle name "seon" and
the "corpus:seon" provenance prefix (src/services/extensions.mjs) regardless of
which directory it lives under. This directory does NOT redistribute SEON's
published ontology files; it is tmct's own curated ontology, named in homage to
that reference vocabulary. No SEON content is copied here.

